<title>USA: Ahmanson presses Great Western holders.</title>
<headline>Ahmanson presses Great Western holders.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson and Co said it is urging Great Western Financial Corp's shareholders to act on Institutional Shareholder Services (ISS) recommendations regarding its consent solicitation.</p>
<p>Earlier, ISS, a group that advises institutional shareholders, backed four of the five proposals on which Ahmanson is seeking consents from Great Western shareholders.</p>
<p>Great Western said it disagreed with the recommendations and urged shareholders to oppose the consent solicitation.</p>
